# Quality Rubric and Evaluation Suite

> Optional trigger-assessment entry point. Generation does not establish a
> quality standard or passing result.

## Applicability assessment

- Status: `not_assessed`
- Triggers: repeated agent work, subjective or model-assisted evaluation, or
  high-impact quality review
- Assessed on: not assessed
- Assessor and basis: not assessed

Record the durable assessment on conceptual type `EVA-0001` in the artifact
registry. `applicable` or `not_applicable` requires `assessed_on`,
`assessed_by`, and a rationale; retain a not-applicable type record after
removing its physical representation.

If justified, define versioned dimensions, thresholds, representative safe
fixtures, raters or execution method, scoring, calibration, failure handling,
and limitations. Generated scores are dated evidence, not the rubric source
or an approval.
